docs {
  Deletes multiple documents in a single request.
  This endpoint cancels any active ingestion on the STB Worker, deletes embeddings from Upstash Vector, removes physical files from MinIO S3 (including the worker-converted PDF for non-PDF documents), deletes records from Postgres, and refunds the upload quota atomically.
  Ideal for partial or full upload cancellation from the frontend.
}
